  id: base_dread_summon_orcs
  title: Summon Orcs
  description: 'This spell summons a group of orcs around the caster to protect them. 
    The number of orcs is determined by rolling 1 red die.


    1, 2 or 3 = 4 orcs.

    4
    or 5 = 5 orcs.

    6 = 6 orcs.'
